          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The general concept of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization"} localization
            applied to the (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+category"}> derived
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+abelian+groups"} category of abelian groups
            yield the concept of
            = succeed "." do
              %em localization of abelian groups
          %p The two main examples are
          %ol
            %li
              %p classical localization at/aways from primes;
            %li
              %p completion at a prime
          %p
            at
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prime+numbers"} prime numbers
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
