            %p
              For the first statement observe that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
              consecutive stages of the tower compose to the
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/zero+morphism"} zero morphism
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tower"} tower
              satisfies the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mittag-Leffler+condition"} Mittag-Leffler condition
              (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+S#MittagLefflerCondition"}> def.
              ) and this implies that the
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
